WEBVTT

00:00:11.492 --> 00:00:13.925
♪ Underwear... ♪

00:00:22.673 --> 00:00:25.144
♪ ALL: Underwear... ♪

00:00:33.871 --> 00:00:36.405
♪ Underwear... ♪

00:00:41.577 --> 00:00:42.620
(BOTH CHUCKLE)

00:00:45.957 --> 00:00:46.999
Oh!

00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:49.669
(MINIONS CHEERING)

00:00:52.201 --> 00:00:54.756
Can I be the first to say, "Ew!"
我能说“好恶心”吗？

00:00:56.781 --> 00:00:58.928
Underwear...

00:01:14.705 --> 00:01:15.731
Okay.
好了

00:01:17.151 --> 00:01:18.252
Excuse me.
不好意思

00:01:19.711 --> 00:01:21.366
Um, hi, excuse me.
不好意思

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:30.751
Uh, (CLEARS THROAT)

00:01:31.127 --> 00:01:34.049
hi, everybody. I'd like to
make some toast.
我有话要说

00:01:35.006 --> 00:01:36.215
Uh...

00:01:37.348 --> 00:01:38.509
Okay.
来吧

00:01:39.886 --> 00:01:40.947
She, um...
她

00:01:41.262 --> 00:01:44.851
She kisses my boo-boos,
she braids my hair.
她亲吻我的伤口

00:01:45.834 --> 00:01:47.759
We love you, mothers, everywhere.
我们爱你 亲爱的妈妈

00:01:49.021 --> 00:01:52.116
And my new mom, Lucy, is beyond compare.
我的新妈妈露西无人能比

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:53.608
MINIONS: Aww.

00:01:53.733 --> 00:01:54.734
Aw.

00:02:01.984 --> 00:02:04.118
To the bride and Gru!
为新娘和格鲁举杯！

00:02:11.709 --> 00:02:13.336
♪ (SINGING Y.M.C.A. IN MINIONESE) ♪

00:02:24.513 --> 00:02:25.556
♪ Yeah! ♪

00:02:37.061 --> 00:02:39.779
-♪ LUCY: Woo-hoo! ♪
- ♪ I'm so happy! ♪
我好高兴！

00:02:49.914 --> 00:02:50.957
Huh? Ha!

00:02:54.627 --> 00:02:56.671
(COUNTING IN MINIONESE)

00:03:03.871 --> 00:03:05.012
Bah!

00:03:25.491 --> 00:03:27.410
Hey, Bob! Stuart!
（小黄人电影试镜）

00:03:59.608 --> 00:04:00.609
(CHUCKLING) Eh!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.103
No?

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.364
Ah!

00:04:08.576 --> 00:04:09.660
Bob!

00:04:09.785 --> 00:04:11.370
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:17.418 --> 00:04:18.461
Uh-oh!

00:04:27.636 --> 00:04:28.763
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:32.645 --> 00:04:34.643
-Okay.
-(COUNTING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:47.198 --> 00:04:48.866
(EXCLAIMING FRANTICALLY)

00:05:02.671 --> 00:05:03.914
(GRUNTS) Okay.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.802
(KAZOOING RHYTHMICALLY)

00:05:15.935 --> 00:05:17.019
(CHUCKLES)

00:05:21.732 --> 00:05:22.775
Aah!

00:05:23.442 --> 00:05:24.735
(CHATTERING ANGRILY IN MINIONESE)

00:05:39.542 --> 00:05:40.584
(KAZOOING)
（超响炮）

00:05:46.048 --> 00:05:47.800
(EXCLAIMING IN ALARM)

00:05:49.385 --> 00:05:50.469
(EXPLODES)

00:05:53.472 --> 00:05:54.557
(OFF-KEY TRUMPETING)

00:05:54.682 --> 00:05:55.724
(KAZOOING RHYTHMICALLY)

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:01.063
(EXCLAIMING IN ALARM)

00:06:05.484 --> 00:06:06.527
(CHUCKLES)

00:06:07.194 --> 00:06:09.613
(BICKERING IN MINIONESE)

00:06:12.324 --> 00:06:13.993
-Mmm?
-Shh!

00:06:18.289 --> 00:06:19.373
(GRUNTS)

00:06:19.498 --> 00:06:20.541
(YELLS)

00:06:21.876 --> 00:06:22.918
(YELLS)

00:06:24.171 --> 00:06:25.588
Blah. (BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:26.881
(YELLING)

